/v1/","context":{"app_id":4545470,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4545470-1847286114039778","game_id":"steam-4545470","kind":"announcement","title":"Shop Glow-Ups, Smoother Progression, and Crow Accessory Fixes","summary":"The shop is starting to look a little more lived in. SHOP UPGRADES YOU CAN SEE Several upgrades now leave a permanent visual mark on the storefront after they are delivered.The Step Stool takes its place beside the counter, the Shelf Organizer adds a gently swaying feather duster, and purchased books begin filling a new shelf built into the counter. Each miniature book spine represents a volume you actually own, so the collection grows alongside your progress.These visual rewards have also been ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T14:40:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114039778","verified_at":"2026-10-24T16:54:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4545470-1841579228677978","game_id":"steam-4545470","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: QoL Updates & Personal Note","summary":"Hi everyone,This update is focused on improving the demo based directly on player feedback. A few players mentioned that while the tutorial was helpful, it could sometimes feel too restrictive, too visually heavy, or unclear about why certain actions mattered.This pass is all about making the early game feel clearer, calmer, and more readable while still protecting players from accidentally breaking the tutorial flow. A More Flexible TutorialSeveral tutorial steps now give you more room to explo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T11:00:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228677978","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4545470-1838407329264304","game_id":"steam-4545470","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Tutorial Smoothing & Player Feedback Fixes","summary":"Thank you to everyone who has been playing the demo and sharing feedback. This update is focused on small but important fixes that make the early game clearer, kinder, and more stable.Tutorial Flow ImprovementsAdded a safety gift from Marrow during the tutorial if you run out of binding materials before the phone catalog and Tithe are available.Fixed an issue where saving and loading during tutorial steps could restore the wrong step or behave as if the tutorial had been skipped.Fixed a rare iss","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-19T21:47:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329264304","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4545470-1836506165575871","game_id":"steam-4545470","kind":"update","title":"Major Demo Update: Meet Tithe, Feed Marrow, and Plan Your Shop Better","summary":"What's New: This is one of the biggest demo updates for The Totemist so far.The headline addition is Tithe, a new character who introduces himself the first time you forget to buy binding kits. If you run out, Tithe gives you a way to buy more immediately at an extremely marked-up price. The idea is simple: you can pay for convenience, or plan ahead and avoid the cost.Tithe also brings a new shop preview menu while you’re in the workshop. You can now:view your shop’s current items in a list form","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-06T12:22:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165575871","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4545470-1836506165558259","game_id":"steam-4545470","kind":"update","title":"Major Demo Update: Community Feedback Pass - June 28, 2026","summary":"Built From FeedbackThis update was created directly in response to community feedback after players spent time with the demo.A lot of the focus this round was on clarity, flow, comfort, and reducing small frustrations.I’ll continue shaping both the demo and the final game around player impressions and suggestions.This patch is less about adding flashy new systems and more about making the existing experience feel smoother, clearer, and more intentional. Tutorial ImprovementsSmoothed out several ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-28T13:58:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165558259","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4545470-1835871199307370","game_id":"steam-4545470","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Faster Intro, Cleaner Onboarding, and New Capsule Art","summary":"The demo for The Totemist has a new update, focused on making the opening of the game feel smoother, clearer, and easier to settle into.As much as story and atmosphere matter to this project, I wanted to take a careful pass at the onboarding experience so players can reach the actual gameplay faster without losing the narrative setup that gives the game its shape. What's changed in the demo Faster, lighter onboardingI reworked the intro flow to make the opening feel snappier and less overwhelmin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-19T14:44:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199307370","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4545470-1834602721196269","game_id":"steam-4545470","kind":"update","title":"The Totemist Demo Update - June 2026","summary":"Demo Update – June Patch NotesI’ve been updating the demo for The Totemist every few days as bug reports and feedback come in. With this latest build, enough has changed that it felt worth sharing a full breakdown of what’s new. Major Balance Updates • Sell Price RebalanceCrafted item values have been fully rebalanced for a smoother progression curve. This includes:Adjusted base sell prices for all craftable itemsA cleaner, slower ramp on ritual imbuing with a lower percentage capThe goal is to ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-07T16:32:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721196269","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4545470-1833334318567603","game_id":"steam-4545470","kind":"announcement","title":"The Totemist Demo is Releasing on June 1st!","summary":"The Totemist demo is officially arriving on June 1st, and I’m excited to finally share the first polished slice of the game with everyone. This build represents months of iteration on early‑game flow, clarity, and the cozy‑occult vibe at the heart of the experience.Whether you joined the recent playtest or you’re stepping into the shop for the first time, this demo is designed to give you a meaningful look at what The Totemist is becoming. What’s Included in the DemoThe complete early‑game craft","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-21T00:25:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318567603","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4545470-1828894815562468","game_id":"steam-4545470","kind":"announcement","title":"Tutorial Overhaul & Progression Journal: Closed Playtest Round 2 Tonight","summary":"Update OverviewA focused clarity and systems pass landed this week based on closed‑playtest feedback. The build tightens onboarding, simplifies item and quest logic, and adds tools to help you track progression and plan crafting. Audio and pacing improvements make the world feel livelier and less grindy. What’s New:• Progression Journal — Automatically logs every item you find and craft, including discovered properties; also keeps short bios for characters you meet.• Active Quest Tracker — A col","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-04T15:31:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828894815562468","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4545470":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:53:30Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:53:29Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4545470":"2026-10-26T02:53:30Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4545470":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:53:29Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:53:29Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4662820":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:53:30Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:53:30Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4545470","app_id":4545470,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:40Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"683d1a1ff718cad80b0273c1e12ef93ea70263e80fbae964568d11ccdca3b2e8","response_sha256":n